     2606                                                       ,input buffer buf_c-dis-card:handle
     2607                                                       ,input buf_dis-card.d-card
     2608                                                       ,input v-rec-ord2
     2609                                                       ,input no
     2610                                                       ).
     2611         run create-smart-route-link in this-procedure ( input 'c-dc-hist':U
